{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>StillRead 是一款專為注重私隱的讀者而設的離線閱讀器，支援 EPUB、PDF 與 TXT，毋須建立帳戶即可閱讀。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-44.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線私密閱讀與標註</h2>\n<p>可從 Files、Mail、Safari 或 Finder 檔案共享匯入書籍，閱讀進度、書籤、標註與設定均留在裝置上。支援 EPUB、PDF 及 TXT，提供繼續閱讀捷徑、書內搜尋、字體與行距調整、閱讀主題、朗讀、自動捲動、閱讀時間估算及簡單統計，且沒有廣告、訂閱、分析或第三方 SDK。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-6-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-7-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-8-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-9-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-10-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-11-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：StillRead: Private Reader</li><li>應用類別：Book</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/stillread-private-reader/id6800770327?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T00:21:09.734033+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T00:08:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T18:58:21.678748+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T00:18:26.190752+00:00","content_hash":"e15cb15f79f7b497dd79731358b08ac38cfb8584b795a28809ecf93cf1600606","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T00:21:09.734033+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}